OL,3,GNEWSAMusician's stolen guitar spotted
OL,4,Ain pawn shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA musician who "lost hope" of ever
OL,7,Ffinding his electric guitar which was
OL,8,Fstolen two years ago has been reunited
OL,9,Fwith his "pride and joy" after it was
OL,10,Fspotted on sale in a pawn shop.
OL,12,FJoshua Locke's Ibanez RRG350, which he
OL,13,Fgot as an 18th birthday present, was
OL,14,Ftaken from his garage in Ipswich on 9
OL,15,FJuly 2024 along with two other guitars
OL,16,Fand a bike.
OL,18,FDesperate to track the instruments
OL,19,Fdown, the 37-year-old guitar teacher
OL,20,Freported the theft to Suffolk Police
OL,21,Fand put an appeal out on social media,
OL,22,Fbut to no avail.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
