OL,3,GNEWSAMusician's stolen guitar spotted
OL,4,Ain pawn shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut, on Thursday, an old school friend
OL,7,Fsent him a photo of his six-stringer on
OL,8,Fdisplay in a local shop for #300 before
OL,9,Fthe police got it back for him the next
OL,10,Fday.
